      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "觀星的醫者",
        "en": "The star-reading healer"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "兩個孩子的母親，船上的領航員，也是醫者。看星象、讀天氣、包紮傷口，樣樣在行。腰間的藥草袋總是鼓鼓的，她說明天會下雨，明天就會下雨。",
        "en": "Mother of the two boys, the ship's navigator and its healer: stars, weather and wounds are all hers to read. Her herb pouch is always full, and when she says it will rain tomorrow, it rains."
      },
