      "name": {
        "zh": "奕叡",
        "en": "Yi Rui"
      },
      "style_name": {
        "zh": "刀客",
        "en": "Swordsman"
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "啟程刀客",
        "en": "The Departing Blade"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "龍門刀莊的長子，背著一把舊環首刀離家闖蕩。話不多，眉眼總是往前看；深藍長袍、藍色頭帶，頭帶的尾巴在風裡飛。他相信再遠的路，都是從第一刀開始的。",
        "en": "Elder son of the Longmen Saber Manor, who left home with an old ring-pommel saber on his back. He says little and always looks ahead, in an indigo robe with a blue headband whose ties fly in the wind. However long the road, he believes it begins with the first cut."
      },
