      "name": {
        "zh": "奕碩",
        "en": "Yi Shuo"
      },
      "style_name": {
        "zh": "弟弟",
        "en": "Little brother"
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "旋風少俠",
        "en": "The Whirlwind Kid"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "奕叡的弟弟，從小不愛拿刀，只愛踢球。紅頭帶、朱紅短褂，右嘴角上方有一顆痣，球從不離腳。看到不公平的事，總是先衝再想。",
        "en": "Yi Rui’s little brother, who never cared for blades, only for kicking a ball. Red headband, vermilion jacket, a mole above the right corner of his mouth, and the ball never far from his feet. When he sees something unfair he charges first and thinks later."
      },
