      "name": {
        "zh": "冷笑天",
        "en": "Leng Xiaotian"
      },
      "style_name": {
        "zh": "暴龍",
        "en": "Tyrant Dragon"
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "暴龍崖之主",
        "en": "Master of Tyrant Dragon Cliff"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "江湖人稱「暴龍」。銀髮金角，黑金龍鱗袍外披猩紅披風，嘴角總掛著一絲冷笑。不用兵器，只用一雙手掌；出手之前，總要先冷笑三聲。",
        "en": "Known on the rivers and lakes as the Tyrant Dragon. Silver hair and golden horns, a black robe worked with gold scales under a crimson cape, and a sneer at one corner of his mouth. He carries no weapon but his palms, and before he strikes he always laughs three cold laughs."
      },
      "weapon": {
