      "name": {
        "zh": "白先生",
        "en": "Mr Bai"
      },
      "style_name": {
        "zh": "說書人",
        "en": "Storyteller"
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "聽雨樓說書人",
        "en": "Storyteller of the Listening-to-Rain"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "十字路口聽雨樓的說書先生。方巾長袖，山羊鬍，醒木一拍，古今江湖的大小消息就從他嘴裡說出來——沒有他不知道的事。",
        "en": "The storyteller of the Listening-to-Rain teahouse at the crossroads. Square cap, long sleeves, a little goatee: one clap of his wooden block and every tale of the rivers and lakes, old and new, comes out of his mouth. There is no news he has not heard."
      },
