      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "寒江閣主",
        "en": "Mistress of the Cold River Pavilion"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "寒江閣的閣主。高髻銀簪，白衣淡藍，一柄細劍。待人冷淡、疑心很重，劍出時霜飛雪落；但欠下的人情，她一定會還。",
        "en": "Mistress of the Cold River Pavilion. A high knot of hair with a silver pin, white over pale blue, and a slender sword. Cool and slow to trust, her sword brings frost and snow when it is drawn; but a debt she owes, she always repays."
      },
