        "en": "Abbot of the Thousand Buddhas"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "千佛寺的住持，白眉長鬚，杏黃僧袍外披紅色袈裟，手持禪杖。總是笑瞇瞇的，說起話來慢條斯理；記性卻好得驚人。",
        "en": "Abbot of the Thousand Buddhas Temple: white brows and a long white beard, a saffron robe under a red kasaya, a monk’s staff in hand. Always smiling and slow of speech, with a remarkably long memory."
