      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "黑風寨二當家",
        "en": "Second of the Black Wind Fort"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "黑風寨的二當家，兩鬢剃得精光，頭頂紮個髮髻；一道長疤從眉梢斜劈到下巴，誰問起來歷，他就把大刀往地上一頓。話少，下手狠，寨裡的規矩都由他來管。",
        "en": "Second chief of the Black Wind Fort, his temples shaved bare and a topknot on his crown. A long scar runs from his brow down to his jaw; ask him where it came from and he only sets his broad dao down hard on the ground. He says little, strikes hard, and keeps the fort's rules."
      },
      "weapon": {
        "zh": "大刀",
        "en": "Broad dao"
