    {
      "id": "shouhou",
      "name": {
        "zh": "瘦猴",
        "en": "Skinny Monkey"
      },
      "style_name": {
        "zh": "嘍囉",
        "en": "Lackey"
      },
      "title": {
        "zh": "黑風寨的跑腿",
        "en": "Errand Boy of the Black Wind Fort"
      },
      "bio": {
        "zh": "黑風寨的小嘍囉，瘦得像根竹竿，一笑就露出兩顆大門牙。衣服補了又補，腰間別一把短刀；眼珠子滴溜溜地轉，哪邊有便宜就往哪邊靠。跑得比誰都快，逃得也比誰都快。",
        "en": "A lackey of the Black Wind Fort, thin as a bamboo pole, who shows two big front teeth whenever he grins. His clothes are patch on patch and a short knife sits at his belt; his eyes dart about for whatever is going cheap. Nobody runs errands faster, and nobody runs away faster either."
      },
      "weapon": {
        "zh": "短刀",
        "en": "Short knife"
      },
